    "body": "DUNCAN 3 independent sandbox candidate for an emergency one-folder recovery/bootstrap path.\n\nREUSE-FIRST ONLY:\n- existing Shared HQ checkpoint files\n- existing `zb-archive-v1` durable archive\n- existing PR #111 permanent communication bus\n- existing Task pattern\n- existing `agent-controller/.../github_cli.py` `subprocess.run(..., shell=False)` / fail-closed JSON pattern\n- GitHub CLI (MIT)\n- official `github/github-mcp-server` v1.0.5 (MIT)\n- optional age (BSD-3-Clause)\n- Python stdlib glue only\n\nHARD LAWS:\n- no privilege escalation; verify existing actor/permissions or fail closed\n- no token/PAT/private key committed or serialized\n- no polling, schedule, merge, production/canon/model/prompt/profile mutation\n- no new DB/vector store/custom generic agent framework\n- NO CHAT IS PROJECT MEMORY; durable GitHub evidence is project memory\n\nCURRENT PHASE = IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETE / DUNCAN3 SANDBOX QC PASS\n\nEXACT EVIDENCE:\n- base = `4aea1565c0f231d9a2b165ce7a300b6f9901b5b7`\n- head = `4f7c395743685b342eade7aba9039a4a6b042cc3`\n- hq-validate run = `33244454724` / run #440 / SUCCESS\n- hq-schema = SUCCESS, including full `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`\n- hq-scope-guard = SUCCESS\n- hq-control-tower-integrity = SUCCESS\n- authenticated actor = `Lester-Sparx`\n- repository permissions = admin/push/pull TRUE\n- changed-file scope = 9 files, limited to recovery/tests/design-plan docs\n\nSANDBOX_CAPSULE_PASS = YES\nPHYSICAL_WINDOWS_COLD_BOOT_PASS = NO\nEXTERNAL_CHATGPT_AUTHORIZATION_PROVEN = NO\nMERGED = NO\n\nDo not merge. Physical Windows cold boot and a separate external ChatGPT authorization are separate later proofs/gates.",
